{"sections":[{"slug":"deRham空间","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"deRham空间"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"de Rham <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"de Rham 空间"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> de Rham <span lang=\"zh\">空间是将</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span> “"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷接近的点","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷接近的点</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等同起来</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">得到的空间</span>.</p>\n<p>de Rham <span lang=\"zh\">空间是无穷小道路群胚的逆范畴化</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而带平坦联络的向量丛等同于无穷小道路群胚上的等变向量丛</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这解释了</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/D-模","text":"D-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为何是带平坦联络的向量丛的推广</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">函子式</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">以</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/点函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">点函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">表达</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> <strong>de Rham <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span></strong> <span lang=\"zh\">是如下函子</span> $X_{\\mathrm{dR}}\\colon \\mathsf{Ring} \\to \\mathsf{Set}$,\n$$\r\nX_{\\text{dR}}(R) := X(R/I),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $I$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">的幂零根</span> (nilpotent radical).</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">对角线形式邻域的商</span></h3>\n<p>$X_{\\text{dR}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">也可表示为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的商</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $X_{\\text{inf}}\\to X\\times X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为对角线的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/形式邻域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式邻域</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则</span>\n$$\r\nX_{\\text{dR}} = \\operatorname{coeq}(X_{\\text{inf}}\\rightrightarrows X).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3>D-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span></h3>\n<p>$$\r\n\\mathsf {QCoh}(X_{\\text{dR}})\\simeq D\\mathsf {-Mod}(X).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}